ysis": null}, {"slug": "build-with-claude/vision", "source_id": "anthropic-api", "source_name": "Anthropic API", "summary": "+1 lines, -1 lines", "added": 1, "removed": 1, "analysis": null}, {"slug": "build-with-claude/context-editing", "source_id": "anthropic-api", "source_name": "Anthropic API", "summary": "+1 lines, -1 lines", "added": 1, "removed": 1, "analysis": null}, {"slug": "build-with-claude/search-results", "source_id": "anthropic-api", "source_name": "Anthropic API", "summary": "+4 lines, -4 lines", "added": 4, "removed": 4, "analysis": null}, {"slug": "build-with-claude/structured-outputs", "source_id": "anthropic-api", "source_name": "Anthropic API", "summary": "+1 lines, -1 lines", "added": 1, "removed": 1, "analysis": null}, {"slug": "build-with-claude/prompt-engineering/prompting-tools", "source_id": "anthropic-api", "source_name": "Anthropic API", "summary": "+1 lines, -1 lines", "added": 1, "removed": 1, "analysis": null}, {"slug": "build-with-claude/prompt-engineering/claude-prompting-best-practices", "source_id": "anthropic-api", "source_name": "Anthropic API", "summary": "+1 lines, -1 lines", "added": 1, "removed": 1, "analysis": null}, {"slug": "agents-and-tools/tool-use/computer-use-tool", "source_id": "anthropic-api", "source_name": "Anthropic API", "summary": "+3 lines, -3 lines", "added": 3, "removed": 3, "analysis": null}], "analysis": "# \u6587\u6863\u53d8\u66f4\u6279\u91cf\u5206\u6790\n\n## 1. \u603b\u4f53\u6458\u8981\n\n\u672c\u6b21\u66f4\u65b0\u6db5\u76d6 27 \u4e2a\u9875\u9762\uff0c\u4e3b\u8981\u6d89\u53ca\uff1a\u65b0\u589e **Claude Mythos 5.1** \u6a21\u578b\u7684\u652f\u6301\u58f0\u660e\u3001**effort level \u89e3\u6790\u4f18\u5148\u7ea7**\u7684\u91cd\u65b0\u5b9a\u4e49\u4e0e\u7ec6\u5316\u3001**thinking block \u7ed1\u5b9a\u9519\u8bef**\u5904\u7406\u6307\u5357\u7684\u91cd\u5927\u4fee\u8ba2\uff0c\u4ee5\u53ca\u591a\u4e2a API/\u4ea7\u54c1\u5c42\u9762\u7684\u529f\u80fd\u589e\u91cf\u4e0e\u63aa\u8f9e\u6f84\u6e05\u3002\n\n## 2. \u5173\u952e\u4e3b\u9898\n\n- **Claude Mythos 5.1 \u767b\u573a**\uff1a\u5728 thinking block\u3001context editing\u3001prompting tools \u7b49\u591a\u5904\u5c06 Mythos 5.1 \u52a0\u5165\u53d7\u652f\u6301\u6a21\u578b\u5217\u8868\uff0c\u4e0e Fable 5.1 \u5e76\u5217\n- **Effort level \u4f53\u7cfb\u91cd\u6784**\uff1a\u89e3\u6790\u4f18\u5148\u7ea7\u4ece 3 \u7ea7\u6269\u5c55\u4e3a 5 \u7ea7\uff08\u73af\u5883\u53d8\u91cf \u2192 \u4f1a\u8bdd\u5185\u9009\u62e9 \u2192 `--effort` flag \u2192 settings \u2192 \u6a21\u578b\u9ed8\u8ba4\uff09\uff1bskill/subagent \u7684 effort \u4f5c\u7528\u57df\u7cbe\u786e\u5316\uff08skill \u4ec5\u5728\u5f53\u524d turn \u5185\u751f\u6548\uff0c\u4e0d\u80fd\u8986\u76d6 `CLAUDE_CODE_EFFORT_LEVEL`\uff09\n- **Thinking block \u9519\u8bef\u5904\u7406\u91cd\u5199**\uff1a\u9519\u8bef\u6807\u9898\u4ece\"no longer matches\"\u6539\u4e3a\"bound to a different conversation\"\uff1b\u660e\u786e\u91cd\u53d1\u540c\u4e00\u5386\u53f2\u4ecd\u4f1a\u5931\u8d25\uff0c\u5fc5\u987b\u7528 `prefix_mismatch_behavior: \"drop_block\"` \u6216\u624b\u52a8\u5265\u79bb block\n- **API \u529f\u80fd\u589e\u91cf**\uff1a\u65b0\u589e `message-threads-2026-08-12` \u548c `analytics-usage-cost-2026-08-24` beta header\uff1b\"Usage and Cost API\" \u66f4\u540d\u4e3a \"Usage and Cost Analytics API\"\n- **\u591a\u56fe\u50cf\u8bf7\u6c42\u5c3a\u5bf8\u9650\u5236\u653e\u5bbd**\uff1a\u5355\u8bf7\u6c42\u8d85 20 \u5f20\u56fe\u65f6\uff0c\u5355\u56fe\u7ef4\u5ea6\u4e0a\u9650\u4ece 2000px \u63d0\u5347\u81f3 3000px\n- **Auto mode hook \u884c\u4e3a\u6f84\u6e05**\uff1a`PreToolUse` \u7684 `ask` \u4e0d\u518d\u65e0\u6761\u4ef6\u5f3a\u5236\u5f39\u7a97\uff1b`SubagentHandback` \u5728 auto mode \u4e0b\u4e0d\u5f39\u7a97\u76f4\u63a5\u6267\u884c\n- **Desktop \u7ec4\u7ec7\u767b\u5f55\u9650\u5236**\uff1a\u65b0\u589e `forceLoginOrgUUID` \u7b56\u7565\u952e\uff0c\u9650\u5236\u53ea\u80fd\u767b\u5f55\u6307\u5b9a\u7ec4\u7ec7\n- **Terminal \u901a\u77e5\u884c\u4e3a\u7ec6\u5316**\uff1aApple Terminal \u7684\u901a\u77e5\u884c\u4e3a\u5355\u72ec\u8bf4\u660e\uff0c\u9ed8\u8ba4\u884c\u4e3a\u66f4\u7cbe\u786e\n\n## 3. \u5f71\u54cd\u7ea7\u522b\uff1a**Medium**\n\n\u65e0\u7834\u574f\u6027\u53d8\u66f4\uff0c\u4f46\u591a\u9879\u884c\u4e3a\u6f84\u6e05\u610f\u5473\u7740\u5f00\u53d1\u8005\u4e4b\u524d\u7684\u7406\u89e3\u53ef\u80fd\u4e0d\u5b8c\u5168\u6b63\u786e\uff1aeffort \u89e3\u6790\u987a\u5e8f\u5df2\u53d8\u3001thinking block \u9519\u8bef\u7684\u91cd\u8bd5\u7b56\u7565\u5df2\u6539\u3001auto mode \u4e0b hook \u7684 `ask` \u884c\u4e3a\u4e0e\u4e4b\u524d\u63cf\u8ff0\u4e0d\u540c\u3002\u5bf9\u4f7f\u7528 preserved thinking \u7684\u5f00\u53d1\u8005\u5f71\u54cd\u6700\u5927\u3002\n\n## 4. \u5f00\u53d1\u8005\u884c\u52a8\u9879\n\n- **\u5ba1\u67e5 effort level \u914d\u7f6e**\uff1a\u5982\u679c\u4f60\u7684 CI/CD \u6216\u811a\u672c\u540c\u65f6\u8bbe\u7f6e\u4e86 `CLAUDE_CODE_EFFORT_LEVEL`\u3001`--effort` \u548c settings \u4e2d\u7684 `effortLevel`\uff0c\u6309\u65b0\u7684 5 \u7ea7\u4f18\u5148\u7ea7\u9a8c\u8bc1\u5b9e\u9645\u751f\u6548\u503c\u662f\u5426\u7b26\u5408\u9884\u671f\n- **\u66f4\u65b0 thinking block \u9519\u8bef\u5904\u7406\u903b\u8f91**\uff1a\u9047\u5230 `invalid_request_error` \u65f6\uff0c\u5355\u7eaf\u91cd\u53d1\u540c\u4e00\u8bf7\u6c42\u4f1a\u6301\u7eed\u5931\u8d25\uff1b\u9700\u5b9e\u73b0 `prefix_mismatch_behavior: \"drop_block\"` \u6216\u5265\u79bb\u9519\u8bef\u6240\u6307 block \u53ca\u5176\u540e\u7eed\u6240\u6709 thinking block\n- **\u5229\u7528\u653e\u5bbd\u7684\u56fe\u50cf\u5c3a\u5bf8\u9650\u5236**\uff1a\u591a\u56fe\u8bf7\u6c42\uff08>20 \u5f20\uff09\u7684\u5355\u56fe\u7ef4\u5ea6\u4e0a\u9650\u5df2\u4ece 2000px \u5347\u81f3 3000px\uff0c\u53ef\u636e\u6b64\u8c03\u6574\u56fe\u50cf\u9884\u5904\u7406\u7ba1\u7ebf\n- **\u9002\u914d Usage and Cost API \u66f4\u540d**\uff1a\u5c06\u4ee3\u7801\u4e2d\u5bf9 `usage-cost-api` \u8def\u5f84\u7684\u5f15\u7528\u66f4\u65b0\u4e3a `usage-cost-analytics-api`\n- **\u68c0\u67e5 hooks \u4e2d\u7684 auto mode \u5047\u8bbe**\uff1a`PreToolUse` hook \u8fd4\u56de `ask` \u5728 auto mode \u4e0b\u4e0d\u518d\u4fdd\u8bc1\u5f39\u51fa\u63d0\u793a\uff1b`SubagentHandback` \u4f1a\u88ab\u81ea\u52a8\u653e\u884c\uff0c\u5982\u9700\u62e6\u622a\u987b\u8fd4\u56de `deny`", "reasoning": "Let me analyze the documentation changes across all 27 pages and provide a concise batch analysis.\n\nKey changes I'm seeing:\n\n1. **Chrome startup dialog** - New section about answering the startup dialog for Chrome extension\n2. **Teleport/Cloud sessions** - Clarifications about teleport behavior with compacted sessions, platform restrictions for self-hosted environments\n3. **Costs** - Simplified background token usage explanation, linking to session recap and idle compaction\n4. **Desktop** - New `forceLoginOrgUUID` policy setting for restricting sign-in to organization\n5. **Hooks** - Updated effort field documentation, new Web search `mode` parameter, clarified PreToolUse `ask` decisions in auto mode, removed incorrect statement about `ask` forcing prompts in auto mode\n6. **Interactive mode** - Minor clarifications on `/model`, `/restart` added to conversation handoff list\n7. **Model config** - Significant rework of effort level resolution order, effort level behavior with skills/subagents, `/model` effort slider behavior\n8. **Monitoring usage** - New `remote_settings_unknowable` reason code, simplified Claude Tag channel description\n9. **Sandboxing** - Symlink coverage for glob patterns in denyWrite\n10. **Setup** - npm 12 warning, duplicate theme attributes (likely rendering artifact)\n11. **Skills** - Updated effort frontmatter documentation\n12. **Slack** - Simplified Claude Tag description\n13. **Status line** - Updated effort.level description\n14. **Terminal config** - Expanded notification behavior documentation for different terminals\n15. **API models list** - Bug fix: `line` changed from \"haiku\" to \"opus\" for Opus 5.5\n16. **API files upload** - New beta headers: `message-threads-2026-08-12`, `analytics-usage-cost-2026-08-24`\n17. **API errors** - Reworked thinking block error documentation, added Claude Mythos 5.1\n18. **Build with Claude overview/text-generation** - \"Usage and Cost API\" renamed to \"Usage and Cost Analytics API\"\n19. **Vision** - Image dimension limit changed from 2000px to 3000px for many-image requests\n20. **Context editing** - Added Claude Mythos 5.1\n21. **Search results** - Minor: \"Boolean\" \u2192 \"boolean\" capitalization fix\n22. **Structured outputs** - Minor: \"Booleans\" \u2192 \"booleans\" capitalization fix\n23. **Prompting tools** - Added Claude Mythos 5.1, simplified thinking block invalidation description\n\nKey themes:\n- Claude Mythos 5.1 is being added as a new model across multiple pages\n- Effort level system is being significantly clarified/reworked\n- Thinking block binding rules are being clarified\n- Various API beta headers are being added\n- Image dimension limits relaxed from 2000px to 3000px\n- Usage and Cost API renamed to Usage and Cost Analytics API\n- Desktop org restriction feature added\n- Auto mode hook behavior clarified\n\nImpact: Medium - No breaking changes per se, but the thinking block error handling guidance has changed significantly, effort level resolution order changed, and image limits were relaxed."}]}